# Development Workflow

- Break large features into clear subtasks with acceptance criteria.
- Implement one subtask at a time.
- After completion:
  - Lint and fix issues.
  - Document the feature.
  - Update `PROJECT_PROGRESS.md`.
- Push changes with concise, conventional commit messages (e.g. `feat: add draggable window manager`).
- Use semantic PR titles and brief descriptions.
